[0.115, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[7G\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m126 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m \u001b[15G`SaveGame`'s migration supplied by the game.  \u001b[62G      \u001b[69G    \u001b[74G   \u001b[78G   \u001b[82G         \u001b[92G        \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m126 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m \u001b[15G`S\u001b[18GveGame`'s migr\u001b[33Gtion supplied by the game.\u001b[48;2;4;71;0m **Done** 2026-11-22, in two commits: `Space::Reason`\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m  \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m127\u001b[11G+\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  \u001b[15G(\"Sp\u001b[20Gc\u001b[22G.Reason\")\u001b[32Gholds the 23 reaso\u001b[51Gs\u001b[53Glane\u001b[58Gtravel,\u001b[66Gcruises\u001b[74Gand\u001b[78Ggates\u001b[84Ggive,\u001b[90Gwith\u001b[95Gits\u001b[99Gown\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m128 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m \u001b[15G`no_su\u001b[22Gh_\u001b[25Gntity` and `not_controller`, as the\u001b[61Gdock\u001b[66Ghas,\u001b[71Gand\u001b[75Gtheir\u001b[81Gwords\u001b[87Gunder\u001b[93G`reason.space.*`\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 129 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   in both tables, which move with the module in slice 6; `Ai::Reason` keeps steering's and the       \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 130 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   helm's eight. No pinned hash moved, the engine's or Manifest's (its 53 suites on the local         \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 131 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   engine). The scene's star-system path, `SceneFile::StarSystem` and `CelestialBodies`,              \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 132 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   `Scene::LoadSystem` and `--system` are deleted, since nothing read them once the sample went;      \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 133 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   `CelestialBodyComponent` is `Scene::BodyComponent`, a body by name that a game may place           \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 134 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   (`PlacementComponent`), its record `celestial` until slice 7. The save's migration from            \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 135 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   version 1 stays the engine's, in neutral words: version 1's info was the engine's own record,      \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 136 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   and its two keys are what that version saved, so a game has nothing to supply. The list at 32:     \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 137 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   the smoke sequence's jump stage's six for slice 4, the dock's 26 for slice 5.                      \u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 138 \u001b[12G\u001b[22m4.\u001b[15G**Transit,\u001b[26Gportals,\u001b[35Gmotion\u001b[42Gprofiles\u001b[51Gand\u001b[55Gslots.**\u001b[64GThe\u001b[68Gneutral\u001b[76Gcapabilities\u001b[89Gas\u001b[92Gan\u001b[95Gengine\u001b[102Gmodule,\u001b[110Gwith\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[2m 139 \u001b[22m    an independent\u001b[30Gconsumer\u001b[39Gin\u001b[42Gits\u001b[46Gsuite\u001b[52G(a\u001b[55Glift\u001b[60Gand\u001b[64Ga\u001b[66Gtrain\u001b[72Gon\u001b[75Ga\u001b[77Gpath,\u001b[83Ga\u001b[85Gdoor\u001b[90Gbetween\u001b[98Gtwo\u001b[102Gframes\u001b[109Gand\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 140 \u001b[15G\u001b[22mone\u001b[19Gwithin\u001b[26Ga\u001b[28Gframe,\u001b[35Ga\u001b[37Gtoll\u001b[42Gbooth's\u001b[50Ggated\u001b[56Gportal,\u001b[64Ga\u001b[66Gcar\u001b[70Gpark's\u001b[77Gbays);\u001b[84Gcruises\u001b[92Grebuilt\u001b[100Gon\u001b[103Gtransit\u001b[111Gand\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning\u001b[11G\u001b[1m2\u001b[13G\u001b[22mshell\u001b[19Gcommands…\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ git log -3 --format=%B\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m*\u001b[15G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m11m 7s\u001b[22G· ↓\u0